atrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & [\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ -4 & -10 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 4\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe third row of the augmented matrix now corresponds to the equation $0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}=-2,$ which has no solution.\n\nSo, there are no values of $s$ and $t$ such that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}sb+tc=u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $u$ does *not* lie on the plane $Π.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399469 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399470 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399471 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399472 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399473 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399473 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399468 1080 #uuid "3ded2025-f849-5e24-ae50-154d00e66f84" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399469 1081 "12" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399469 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399469 1084 #uuid "5469c2f4-10d4-551a-8387-1f41e195f9f3" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399470 1081 "-9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399470 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399470 1084 #uuid "b5aaf75e-0319-5e2f-b6a1-406f9f457622" 131941